sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant P as Pedidos
    participant S as Stock
    participant G as Pagos
    C->>P: POST /orders
    P-->>C: 202 Accepted (PENDING)
    P-)S: pedido.creado
    Note over S: reserva unidades
    S-)G: stock.reservado
    Note over G: cobra al cliente
    G-)P: pago.aceptado
    Note over P: pedido APPROVED
    C->>P: GET /orders/{id}
    P-->>C: APPROVED
